## Day 11 – Containment and Recovery

What I learned today:
- Difference between containment and recovery
- Why both steps are required after an incident

Example I understood:
- Block attacker IP (containment)
- Reset user credentials (recovery)

Why this matters:
Proper containment and recovery
prevent repeated attacks and system damage.

What confused me:
- How SOC teams decide when to move
from containment to recovery

Next step:
Learn how incidents are documented and reported.
